<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ryland Group upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ryland Group upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it upgraded Ryland Group Inc to trading buy from underperform.</p>
<p>-- analyst Jasmine Perry said put six-month price target of $20 on shares, which rose 1-3/4 to 16-1/2.</p>
<p>-- in a report said Ryland is &quot;a turnaround story with regard to return to profitability from home building.&quot;</p>
<p>-- raised 1997 earnings per share estimate to $1.00 from $0.92.</p>
<p>-- boosted 1998 view to $1.50 from $1.15.</p>
</text>
